During staging, if the player never engaged the clutch, engine rpm target idle.

Steering smoothing in update: `this.steer += (this.steerTarget - this.steer)*min(1,dt*8)`. For touch wheel, steerTarget set directly. For keyboard, target = -1/1/0.

